### ── Point 4: Hero Section Skill Tag Visibility on Laptops
- **File**: `src/components/sections/hero.tsx`
- **Current Problem**: Skill badges rendered at `text-[9px]` with thin `border-white/40`.
- **Operational Implementation**:
  - Update `UNIFIED_CANVAS_BASELINE` tag font size to `fontSize: 11` (or `12`).
  - In `renderStudioNode`, style tags with:
    ```tsx
    className="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xs border border-white/60 bg-black/90 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase text-white shadow-xl"
    ```

---

### ── Point 5 & 8: Typography Standardization & Cursive Usage Boundaries
- **Files**: `src/app/globals.css`, `tailwind.config.ts`, all section components
- **Rule Engine**:
  - **Display Headings**: `font-display` (`Space Grotesk`, sans-serif, bold, tight tracking).
  - **Body Text**: `font-sans` (`Inter`, sans-serif, regular/medium, relaxed line height).
  - **Technical Meta & Badges**: `font-mono` (`Space Mono`, monospace, uppercase, tracked).
  - **Handwritten Accents (`Caveat`)**: **MAXIMUM 1–4 WORDS ONLY** (e.g. *"curious by nature"*, *"plans changed."*). **NEVER** use for multi-line explanations or primary section headings.

---

### ── Point 6 & 7: Research Archive Legibility & Metadata Contrast
- **File**: `src/components/sections/research-archive.tsx`
- **Current Problem**: Supervisor and institution names render in `text-[#1a1a1a]/50 text-[10px]` monospace text on light paper backgrounds.
- **Operational Implementation**:
  - Change metadata typography to:
    ```tsx
    <div className="mt-3 border-l-2 border-[#1738D5] pl-3">
      <p className="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[#1a1a1a]/90">
        Advisor: {paper.supervisor}
      </p>
      <p className="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#1a1a1a]/70">
        {paper.institution}
      </p>
    </div>
    ```

---

### ── Point 9: Section-to-Section Continuity & Header Hierarchy
- **Files**: All files in `src/components/sections/`
- **Pattern**: Every section must follow the uniform header banner blueprint:
  ```tsx
  <div className="mb-8">
    <div className="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#1738D5] mb-2">
      <span>{index}</span>
      <span>/</span>
      <span className="text-[#1a1a1a]/70">{category}</span>
    </div>
    <h2 className="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-display tracking-tight text-[#1a1a1a]">
      {headline}
    </h2>
    {subtitle && (
      <p className="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#1a1a1a]/70 font-sans max-w-2xl">
        {subtitle}
      </p>
    )}
  </div>
  ```

