- [ ] Every major heading is 2–4 words on a single line.
- [ ] "The Beginning" is scannable in under 10 seconds.
- [ ] High-signal entities are bolded across all body copy.
- [ ] Hero skill badges are clearly legible on 13"–15" laptop screens (`11px–12px font-semibold`).
- [ ] Supervisor metadata in research cards has crisp WCAG AA contrast (`#1a1a1a/85`).
- [ ] Career Metro has visible, clickable next/prev buttons and direct station jump dots.
- [ ] Rotated taped note card no longer overlaps text on mobile.
- [ ] Contact section includes clickable phone (`tel:`), clickable email (`mailto:`), and résumé request CTA.
- [ ] `npm run build` compiles with 0 errors.

